output:
MTE2-A-single-HBM = singleM * singleK * sizeof(ADtype) / MTE2-HBM
MTE2-A-single-L2 = singleM * singleK * sizeof(ADtype) / MTE2-L2
MTE2-B-single-HBM = singleN * singleK * sizeof(BDtype) / MTE2-HBM
MTE2-B-single-L2 = singleN * singleK * sizeof(BDtype) / MTE2-L2
MTE1-a-base = baseM * baseK * sizeof(ADtype) / MTE1
MTE1-b-base = baseN * baseK * sizeof(BDtype) / MTE1
CUBE-single = singleM * singleN * singleK / CUBE
CUBE-base = baseM * baseN * baseK / CUBE
FIXP-single-L2 = singleM * singleN * sizeof(CDtype) / FIXP-L2
FIXP-single-Ub = singleM * singleN * sizeof(CDtype) / FIXP-Ub

举例：
input:
ADtype = bf16
BDtype = bf16
CDtype = bf16
